        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782670253796,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adjacent cell of (1,2) :\n(cx + 1, cy) and (cx, cy + 1) = (2, 2) and (1, 3)\n\nAdjacent cell of (2,3) :\n(cx, cy - 1) and (cx -1 , cy) = (2, 2) and (1, 3)\n\nComparaison between (vx - 1, vy - 1) and (cx + 1, y) tell us if the vertex N branch existe\nComparaison between (vx - 1, vy - 1) and (cx, cy + 1) tell us if the vertex W branch existe\n\nComparaison between (vx , vy) and (cx , cy - 1) tell us if the vertex E branch existe\nComparaison between (vx , vy) and (cx -1 , cy) tell us if the vertex S branch existe\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Adjacent cell of (1,2) :\n(cx + 1, cy) and (cx, cy + 1) = (2, 2) and (1, 3)\n\nAdjacent cell of (2,3) :\n(cx, cy - 1) and (cx -1 , cy) = (2, 2) and (1, 3)\n\nComparaison between (vx - 1, vy - 1) and (cx + 1, y) tell us if the vertex N branch existe\nComparaison between (vx - 1, vy - 1) and (cx, cy + 1) tell us if the vertex W branch existe\n\nComparaison between (vx , vy) and (cx , cy - 1) tell us if the vertex E branch existe\nComparaison between (vx , vy) and (cx -1 , cy) tell us if the vertex S branch existe\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
